      "review_summary": "The PR adds a Mattermost thread-fetch helper, session-gated inbound thread-history backfill, and regression coverage for cold recovery, same-session suppression, failed-fetch no-retry, and reset refetch.\n\nPR surface: Source +142, Tests +421. Total +563 across 5 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level. Current main builds Mattermost thread context from process-local channelHistories and the shared turn kernel clears that window after turns, with no server-thread fetch to recover context after restart or session reset.",
